OL,3,CTraffic disruptions as all-Ireland
OL,4,CFleadh comes to town
OL,6,FBelfast is in the final stages of
OL,7,Fpreparations for one of the biggest
OL,8,Fmusic festivals in its history.
OL,10,FThe Fleadh Cheoil na hEireann is
OL,11,Fexpecting to host around 800,000
OL,12,Fpeople through eight days from Sunday,
OL,13,FAugust 2.
OL,15,FBilled as the world's largest
OL,16,Fcelebration of Irish music, dance and
OL,17,Fculture, it will see the city
OL,18,Ftransformed and take centre stage.
OL,26,@rD@Wrb
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G1/13
