OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1785525522
OL,3,CTraffic disruptions as all-Ireland
OL,4,CFleadh comes to town
OL,6,FAhead of Sunday's opener, Belfast City
OL,7,FCouncil and pubic transport operator
OL,8,FTranslink are urging the public to
OL,9,Fplan ahead and leave extra time for
OL,10,Fjourneys.
OL,12,FAs part of the city's transformation,
OL,13,Fa large area of the city centre will
OL,14,Fbe pedestrianised to create a safe and
OL,15,Fwelcoming festival zone.
OL,17,FSome of the artists involved in the
OL,18,F2026 event include musician Sharon
OL,19,FShannon and her Big Band who will
OL,20,Fheadline the main stage outside
OL,21,FBelfast City Hall on Sunday August 2.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/13
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
