PN,41503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1785525522
OL,3,CTraffic disruptions as all-Ireland
OL,4,CFleadh comes to town
OL,6,FOther acts performing on the famous
OL,7,FGig Rig stage for the opening ceremony
OL,8,Fwill be award-winning group Goitse,
OL,9,Fthe Blackwater Ceili Band and Belfast
OL,10,Fensemble McPeake.
OL,12,FThe line-up will also include a range
OL,13,Fof school choirs, as well as cross-
OL,14,Fcommunity and multicultural
OL,15,Fperformances, creating a day of free
OL,16,Fentertainment and setting the tone for
OL,17,Fa week of multi-generational shared
OL,18,Fcelebration across the city.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/13
