OL,3,CTraffic disruptions as all-Ireland
OL,4,CFleadh comes to town
OL,6,FBelfast City Council has warned that
OL,7,Froad closures and diversions will come
OL,8,Finto effect from 5am on Sunday 2 until
OL,9,F7am on Monday 10 August.
OL,11,FPublic transport is the recommended
OL,12,Fway to arrive as no parking or waiting
OL,13,Frestrictions will make driving through
OL,14,Fthe city centre difficult.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/13
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
