PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1785525522
OL,3,CTraffic disruptions as all-Ireland
OL,4,CFleadh comes to town
OL,6,FAnyone travelling from outside the
OL,7,Fcity is encouraged to use public
OL,8,Ftransport for their whole journey, or
OL,9,Fto complete it with a free shuttle bus
OL,10,Foperating from three low-cost Fleadh
OL,11,FPark and Ride sites. Two of the three
OL,12,Fsites will also offer overnight
OL,13,Fparking options.
OL,15,FCitybased residents are encouraged to
OL,16,Fwalk, cycle or use public transport.
OL,18,FPublic transport
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/13
