OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1785525522
OL,3,CTraffic disruptions as all-Ireland
OL,4,CFleadh comes to town
OL,6,FAll Metro, Glider, Ulsterbus and train
OL,7,Fservices will operate throughout the
OL,8,Fevent.
OL,10,FThere will be temporary alterations to
OL,11,Fsome bus stops and pick-up points
OL,12,Faround City Hall with any changes
OL,13,Fsignposted on-site, via the Translink
OL,14,Fwebsite and Journey Planner App.
OL,16,FAdditional late-night bus and rail
OL,17,Fservices will be in place on Sunday 2
OL,18,FAugust, then again from Thursday 6 to
OL,19,FSunday 9 August, to help visitors get
OL,20,Fhome safely after evening events.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/13
