PN,41507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F415A1785525522
OL,3,CTraffic disruptions as all-Ireland
OL,4,CFleadh comes to town
OL,6,FSpecial Fleadh day return bus services
OL,7,Fwill depart towns and cities across
OL,8,FNorthern Ireland (subject to demand)
OL,9,Fand are available to pre-book online.
OL,11,FThree official Fleadh Park and Ride
OL,12,Fsites will operate at Eikon Exhibition
OL,13,FCentre, Sprucefield (near M1), Giant's
OL,14,FPark (near M2) and Belfast Harbour
OL,15,FEstate (near M3), offering an easy
OL,16,Falternative to driving into the city
OL,17,Fcentre.
OL,19,FLarge format directional signage will
OL,20,Fbe in place to guide drivers to the
OL,21,Flocations.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G7/13
