OL,3,CTraffic disruptions as all-Ireland
OL,4,CFleadh comes to town
OL,6,FFrequent shuttle buses, running every
OL,7,F10 minutes at peak times, will connect
OL,8,Fall three sites to the city centre on
OL,9,Fevery event day, with single-day and
OL,10,Fmulti-day options available (day
OL,11,Fparking only at Giant's Park).
OL,13,FWalking and cycling
OL,15,FMost Fleadh venues are within easy
OL,16,Fwalking distance of each other so
OL,17,Fvisitors can get from event to event
OL,18,Fon foot.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G8/13
