OL,3,CTraffic disruptions as all-Ireland
OL,4,CFleadh comes to town
OL,6,FAll three Fleadh Park and Ride sites
OL,7,Fhave disabled parking located close to
OL,8,Fshuttle bus pick-up points, while the
OL,9,Ffleet into the city centre will have
OL,10,Flow floors for easy access.
OL,12,FDedicated parking, operating on a
OL,13,Ffirst-come, first-served basis, will
OL,14,Fbe available for Blue Badge holders at
OL,15,FDunbar Street (outside Common Market)
OL,16,Fand Winetavern Street/Smithfield
OL,17,FMarket.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G10/13
