OL,3,CTraffic disruptions as all-Ireland
OL,4,CFleadh comes to town
OL,6,FA free city centre loop service will
OL,7,Falso operate during the event helping
OL,8,Fto transport those with mobility
OL,9,Fissues, families or those carrying
OL,10,Fheavy instruments around the event
OL,11,Fzone.
OL,13,FTaxis and coaches
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G11/13
