OL,3,CTraffic disruptions as all-Ireland
OL,4,CFleadh comes to town
OL,6,FTaxi services will continue to
OL,7,Foperate, with dedicated pick-up and
OL,8,Fdrop-off locations located around the
OL,9,Fedge of the pedestrianised event zone,
OL,10,Fat Corporation Street, Little Donegall
OL,11,FStreet, junction of North Street and
OL,12,FRoyal Avenue, King Street, Adelaide
OL,13,FStreet and Chichester Street.
OL,15,FAll main taxi operators have been
OL,16,Finformed of these arrangements and
OL,17,Fwill make users aware of their
OL,18,Fcollection point when booking a fare
OL,19,Fby phone or when using an app.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}           G12/13
