OL,3,CTraffic disruptions as all-Ireland
OL,4,CFleadh comes to town
OL,6,FPublic hire taxis will operate as
OL,7,Fnormal with some temporary relocations
OL,8,Fat peak visitor times.
OL,10,FCoach and tour bus services will
OL,11,Foperate from Linenhall Street, as well
OL,12,Fas three dedicated parking sites,
OL,13,Fthroughout the event.
